  "description": "Privacy Enhancing Technology (PET) operations platform enabling federated learning and multi-party computation across distributed healthcare data. Institutions keep their sensitive data locally; only aggregated results leave the node. Delivers a central server, node agents, Python client, CLI, algorithm store, and Angular UI as Docker images.",
