  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "One of the most mature open-source federated learning platforms available for healthcare research, with 246 releases and v4.14.0 as of March 2026. Pip-installable, fully Dockerised, with a dedicated algorithm store and OHDSI/OMOP algorithm base image. EU-origin with GDPR-aligned architecture — data never leaves the node. Zenodo DOI, CITATION.cff, AMIA 2020 peer-reviewed paper, and a Research Software Directory listing make it fully citable for academic use. The principal caution is community (not foundation) governance, but 8,000+ commits and 8+ years of active development substantially reduce the bus-factor risk.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-11",
